            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# FLOW 1.0.1283

Provider packages keep the opponent from their own import receipt. Opening a package repairs older opponent metadata that was incorrectly replaced by another game on the same date. Game-history reconciliation no longer guesses between multiple same-day games or overwrites an explicit opponent with a conflicting date-only match.

Includes the exact package filename header and FLOW package icons in Finder.
]]></description>
